# The UI build output. Ignored so CI can build it fresh, but .gitkeep is tracked
# on purpose: internal/api/fronend.go embeds this directory, and `//go:embed`
# fails the BUILD when its pattern matches nothing ("no matching files found").
# Without a tracked file here, `go build ./...` is broken on a fresh clone until
# someone runs the UI build. The directive uses the `all:` prefix so that a
# directory holding only .gitkeep still satisfies it — plain `//go:embed webdist`
# skips dot-prefixed files and fails with "contains no embeddable files".
# ui/public/.gitkeep restores this file after vite's emptyOutDir wipes the tree.
internal/api/webdist/*
!internal/api/webdist/.gitkeep
